    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i appreciate that, but a psychologist feels like they're just trying to fix a machine that's already broken. it's more than just \"transitioning.\" it's like the movie ended and the lights came on, but there's no sequel. i'm just sitting here in the dark watching the credits roll on my own life. it's hard to see the point in trying to \"rebuild\" something when the foundation is just... gone.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
