      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "These feelings of profound loss and the inability to see a \"sequel\" to your former life are valid, yet recognizing the legitimate grief in this situation is the first step toward finding a path forward. Professional support can be tailored to validate your pain rather than force a mechanical \"repair,\" helping you confront why your identity was so deeply tied to your sport. Even in this darkness, exploring new narratives that don't rely on your past achievements as the sole foundation can eventually restore a sense of agency to your existence.",
      "source": "target",
