    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, i don't want a \"new narrative.\" i don't want to spend the next forty years trying to find meaning in mediocre stuff just to fill the void left by something great. it feels dishonest, you know? like I'm just pretending to be a person instead of actually being one. if the peak is over and i'm just descending the mountain, isn't it more dignified to just... stop? instead of dragging out the decline?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
